{"file":"forgeproof-1.4.0-v2.zip","bytes":307804,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"forgeproof","description":"Converts GitHub issues into working code with cryptographically signed provenance bundles. Every file edit, design decision, and test result is recorded in a tamper-evident Ed25519 hash chain. The .rpack bundle lets reviewers verify AI-generated code was not altered after creation — no external services, no API keys, pure local cryptography.","version":"1.4.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/ryanjmichie-git/forgeproof-plugin","homepage":"https://github.com/ryanjmichie-git/forgeproof-plugin","keywords":["provenance","audit-trail","cryptographic","ed25519","github","code-generation","compliance","security","signing","verification"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/push/SKILL.md","name":"push","description":"Push a ForgeProof branch and open a pull request with provenance metadata embedded in the PR description. Use after running /forgeproof:run to create a PR from the generated code. Triggers on \"push forgeproof\", \"create PR from forgeproof\", or \"open pull request with provenance\".","headings":["ForgeProof Push: Branch & PR Creation","Step 1 — Identify the ForgeProof branch","Step 2 — Verify bundle is committed at HEAD","Step 3 — Push branch","Step 4 — Generate PR body","Step 5 — Create PR"],"name_hint":"push","description_zh":"在 ForgeProof run 后推送生成代码分支并创建 PR，将来源追踪元数据写入描述，适用于带可追溯证据的合并请求。"},{"path":"skills/reset/SKILL.md","name":"reset","description":"Clean up ForgeProof local state for an issue or all issues. Deletes provenance chains, bundles, ephemeral keys, and optionally branches. Use when you need to re-run ForgeProof on an issue or clean up after testing. Triggers on \"reset forgeproof\", \"clean up forgeproof\", or \"forgeproof reset\".","headings":["ForgeProof Reset: Clean Up Local State","Step 1 — Determine scope","Step 2 — Clean up provenance state","Step 3 — Clean up git branches","Step 4 — Optionally clean up remote branches","Step 5 — Report"],"name_hint":"reset","description_zh":"清理单个或全部问题的 ForgeProof 本地状态，包括来源链、证据包、临时密钥及可选分支，用于重新运行或测试后清理。"},{"path":"skills/run/SKILL.md","name":"run","description":"Create provenance-tracked code from a GitHub issue with a cryptographically signed audit trail. Use when the user asks to \"forgeproof an issue\", \"create a provenance bundle\", \"generate auditable code from an issue\", or wants cryptographically signed proof of AI-generated work. Supports Python, TypeScript/JavaScript, and Go projects. Invoke with an issue number or without one to browse assigned issues.","headings":["ForgeProof: Provenance-Tracked Code Generation","Issue Selection","Phase 0 — Preflight","Phase 1 — Parse & Plan","Phase 2 — Generate",".gitignore check","Initialize and branch","Rules during generation","Phase 3 — Evaluate","Phase 4 — Package","Reference Documentation"],"name_hint":"run","description_zh":"根据 GitHub 问题生成带来源追踪和加密签名审计轨迹的代码，支持 Python、TypeScript/JavaScript 和 Go，可指定问题号或浏览分派问题。"},{"path":"skills/verify/SKILL.md","name":"verify","description":"Verify a ForgeProof provenance bundle (.rpack file). Use when the user asks to \"verify a bundle\", \"check provenance\", \"validate an rpack\", \"verify forgeproof\", or wants to confirm that AI-generated code has not been tampered with since signing. Supports verifying bundles from other repositories or PRs.","headings":["ForgeProof Verify: Bundle Integrity Check","Step 1 — Locate the bundle","Step 2 — Run verification","Step 3 — Report results","Verify with cosign instead (alternative view — never a required step)","Verify a PR's bundle"],"name_hint":"核验","description_zh":"验证 ForgeProof .rpack 来源证据包，确认 AI 生成代码签名后未被篡改，也支持其他仓库或 PR 的证据包。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["ForgeProof","Install","Requirements","Upgrading from 1.0.x","Supported Languages","Usage","Generate code from an issue","Push to a PR","Verify a bundle","Verify with cosign (optional — interop only)","Verify on every PR","Clean up state","Re-running on the same issue","How It Works","The .rpack Bundle","Format identity","Security Model","Privacy","Troubleshooting","Known Limitations","Hooks (Automatic Behavior)","Testing & Validation"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".gitattributes",".github/jsonschema-requirements.txt",".github/workflows/ci.yml",".github/workflows/stress.yml",".github/workflows/verify-provenance.yml",".gitignore","CHANGELOG.md","LICENSE","PLAN_v1.1.0.md","PLAN_v1.2.0.md","PLAN_v1.3.0.md","PLAN_v1.4.0.md","PRIVACY.md","README.md","ROADMAP.md","docs/branch-protection.md","docs/compliance-mapping.md","docs/cosign-interop.md","docs/media-type.md","hooks/hooks.json","schemas/forgeproof-rpack-1.schema.json","share/magic/forgeproof","share/mime/packages/forgeproof-rpack.xml","skills/push/SKILL.md","skills/reset/SKILL.md","skills/run/SKILL.md","skills/run/references/chain-format.md","skills/run/references/rpack-format.md","skills/run/references/toolchain-detection.md","skills/run/scripts/conftest.py","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v101/chain-999.json","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v101/issue-999.rpack","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v101/src/example.py","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v110/chain-998.json","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v110/issue-998.rpack","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v110/src/example2.py","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v122/chain-997.json","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v122/issue-997.rpack","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v122/src/example3.py","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v130/chain-996.json","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v130/issue-996.rpack","skills/run/scripts/fixtures/v130/src/example_v130.py","skills/run/scripts/forgeproof.py","skills/run/scripts/test_forgeproof.py","skills/verify/SKILL.md","stress/check_detection.py","stress/generate_projects.py","stress/make_bundle.py","stress/run_stress.py","stress/validate_schema.py"],"sha256":"849a5771365a27186f474fffb8b6269e9528